<reference id="reference-4045" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">PKI Authentication Scheme (clientCertAuth-PKIAuthenticationScheme)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component adds a new
authentication scheme to the station, allowing the user to log in using PKI-
based client certificate authentication.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><author translate="no" type="creator" class="- topic/author ">Claudia Serwe &lt;claudia.serwe@tridium.com&gt;</author><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "/></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section ">
    
    <p class="- topic/p "><image placement="break" width="600" href="../graphic/StationSecuity_PKIAuthenticationScheme.png" class="- topic/image "/><ul class="- topic/ul "><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">Component location: <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">clientCertAuth</apiname> palette </p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">To access these properties, expand    <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Services</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Authentication Service</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Authentication Schemes</uicontrol></menucascade> folder. </p></li></ul></p>
    
    </section><properties class="- topic/simpletable reference/properties "><prophead class="- topic/sthead      reference/prophead "><proptypehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptypehd ">Property</proptypehd><propvaluehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvaluehd ">Value</propvaluehd><propdeschd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdeschd ">Description</propdeschd></prophead><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Login Button Text</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">text</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><p class="- topic/p ">Displays the text that will be displayed
on the browser login form. It is recommended that you  create a  text that describes to the
user what type of login will be used, for example, "Log in with CAC".</p></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">CA Certificates</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">folder (additional properties)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><p class="- topic/p ">A folder containing
CA configurations. Each CA configuration describes which CA is used for
validation, to which rules the client certificates must conform, and how to find
the username in the client certificate.</p></propdesc></property></properties></refbody></reference>